message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "KotenOCR for Android"
abstract: "An Android app that reads classical Japanese texts (kuzushiji) and modern printed Japanese texts entirely on-device, using the National Diet Library's NDL Koten OCR-Lite and NDLOCR-Lite models."
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/nakamura196/koten-ocr-android"
url: "https://kotenocr.ldas.jp/android-en.html"
authors:
  - family-names: Nakamura
    given-names: Satoru
    affiliation: "The University of Tokyo"
    email: "nakamura.satoru@mail.u-tokyo.ac.jp"
keywords:
  - OCR
  - kuzushiji
  - classical Japanese
  - digital humanities
  - Android
  - ONNX Runtime
references:
